---
// FinalCTA.astro
---

<section class="final-cta">
  <!-- Subtle Background Official Z + Razor Watermark -->
  <div class="final-cta-watermark" aria-hidden="true">
    <img src="/images/logo-symbol.png" alt="" width="520" height="520" loading="lazy" />
  </div>
  
  <div class="cta-warm-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="shell">
    <div class="final-cta-content reveal">
      <div class="cta-badge">
        <span>SEU PRÓXIMO CORTE</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="display-title section-title">O visual impecável que você quer começa com um clique.</h2>
      <p class="body-lead">
        Escolha sua unidade favorita, reserve com o seu barbeiro de confiança e viva a melhor experiência de barbearia de Cuiabá.
      </p>

      <div class="final-cta-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-yellow cta-primary-btn" href="https://cashbarber.com.br/zangadinbarbearia" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span>Agendar Meu Horário Agora</span>
          <span class="btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>

        <div class="cta-or-divider">
          <span>ou prefere falar conosco?</span>
          <a class="text-link-yellow" href="https://wa.me/5565999999999?text=Ol%C3%A1%2C%20gostaria%20de%20agendar%20um%20hor%C3%A1rio%20na%20Zangadin" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            Chamar no WhatsApp →
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="cta-trust-row">
          <span>⚡ Agendamento instantâneo em menos de 1 min</span>
          <span class="dot-sep">·</span>
          <span>📍 2 Unidades em Cuiabá</span>
          <span class="dot-sep">·</span>
          <span>☕ Café moído &amp; Chopp cortesia</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .final-cta {
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 50%, #01245C 0%, #00183F 100%);
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 100px 0;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .final-cta-watermark {
    position: absolute;
    right: 3%;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    width: clamp(300px, 36vw, 540px);
    height: clamp(300px, 36vw, 540px);
    opacity: 0.045;
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .final-cta-watermark img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    filter: brightness(0) invert(1);
    transform: rotate(-3deg);
  }

  .cta-warm-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 20%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 600px;
    height: 350px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(246, 196, 16, 0.1) 0%, rgba(1, 36, 92, 0) 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
    filter: blur(50px);
  }

  .final-cta-content {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .cta-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--yellow-main);
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .final-cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 36px;
  }

  .cta-primary-btn {
    padding: 18px 38px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(246, 196, 16, 0.35);
  }

  .cta-or-divider {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }

  .cta-trust-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding-top: 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .cta-trust-row span:not(.dot-sep) {
    color: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .dot-sep {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  }
</style>